## Recovery distinction

0x6cd8 can conditionally call0x63b8 at0x6e2c when0x883c()==0. Do not label
it unconditional immediate halt.0x63b8 may replay slots14..23 after partial
runtime/auth reset and selecting mode0x101, unless already retried orcurrent
path13/0x101. On success:
  0x6478 e5b71014 LDR r1,[r7,#0x14]!
  0x647c e5970014 LDR r0,[r7,#0x14]
  0x6480 e1a0e00f MOV lr,pc
  0x6484 e12fff11 BX r1
Meaningful entry/shared registers agree with normal handoff, butLR=0x6488
and its32-byte frame remain. Skipped retry/image return may enter once-only
0x251c fallback. Only terminal fallthrough0x6e90 reaches0x1fc, whose register
clear ends at spin0x230. No claim of which path ran is made.

## Limits

Hash/anchor checks cannot certify semantic names. Full MMIO meanings, clock
units, selected hardware policy, vendor types, SDCC/USB internals and complete
crypto contracts are explicitly unresolved. No PBL emulation or execution
trace was produced. A successful ROM read does not establish that a modified
SBL1 will authenticate or boot. Firmware rights remain separate from project
analysis; original notice and full zero suffix are preserved.

Independent offline review completed with no blockers. Reviewer independently decoded about 25 instruction windows, recomputed literal addresses, and verified the 24-slot/12-callback dispatch, writeback-addressed normal handoff, loader/auth separation, statuses/ranges, recovery-vs-halt distinction, shared-record fields and absence of live-policy/CPU-identity overclaims. Its independent boot-main decode matched the tool output byte/mnemonic-wise; make check passed55 tests and listings reproduced. Crypto/controller internals were not reviewed. The SBL1 consumer cross-check was intentionally outside the isolated reviewer snapshot; its exact artifact hash and supporting instructions are recorded earlier in this parent note. The reviewer also saw the precommit snapshot without remotes/notes; in the parent worktree the analysis is committed as341ffacead5f26a60b269bff3dbfbcb7fe97105c and both import/analysis notes exist. Publication remains pending authorization to seed the empty default branch.
